# Non-runtime files excluded from deployment entirely — preferred over an
# endless vercel.json deny-route list (see docs/refactor/DECISIONS.md D8).
# Nothing in the app fetches any of these at runtime (verified via grep before
# adding this file) — see docs/refactor/SECURITY_REGISTER.md §1/§6.
#
# This is a SECOND, independent layer alongside the vercel.json deny-routes
# in the same commit — kept even though it overlaps, because .vercelignore
# excludes files from the deployment bundle entirely (no path can reach them,
# regardless of trailing slashes, case, or future new deny-route gaps),
# whereas vercel.json routes only block specific matched paths after the
# file is already present in the deployment.

# Internal documentation — never meant to be served as web pages
*.md
14files/

# Database schema, migrations, RLS source — not runtime code
sql/

# Operational/one-off scripts — not served to the browser
scripts/

# This refactor's own working docs
docs/

# Legacy/orphaned snapshots and folders (already gitignored for new files,
# but earlier commits tracked files under these paths before that rule
# existed — .gitignore does not retroactively exclude already-tracked files
# from git, and Vercel deploys whatever git tracks)
archive/
Deploy_SwimLoading/

# Sponsor CRM — contains commercial pipeline data, not a runtime page
Sponsors/
